                  "title": "Client-side skimming via XSS or third-party script",
                  "status": "Open",
                  "severity": "High",
                  "type": "Information disclosure",
                  "description": "Injected JavaScript on the checkout page captures card numbers as they are typed (Magecart-style). Whiteboard: XSS.",
                  "mitigation": "Output encoding, strict Content-Security-Policy, Subresource Integrity, script inventory and change detection (PCI DSS 6.4.3 / 11.6.1), hosted payment fields / iframe tokenisation.",
