                  "status": "Open",
                  "severity": "Medium",
                  "type": "Elevation of privilege",
                  "description": "An admin abuses or mishandles standing access to the cardholder DB.",
                  "mitigation": "Least privilege, dual control for CDE access, session recording, bulk-read alerting.",
