                  "status": "Open",
                  "severity": "High",
                  "type": "Information disclosure",
                  "description": "Staging is internet-reachable, less hardened, and may hold copied production card data or the same credentials as prod; foothold for lateral movement.",
                  "mitigation": "Remove public exposure (VPN/allow-list), synthetic or tokenised test data only, separate AWS accounts and secrets per environment.",
