                  "title": "Card data scraped from memory or logs",
                  "status": "Open",
                  "severity": "High",
                  "type": "Information disclosure",
                  "description": "With code execution, PANs in memory or accidentally logged are harvested directly - DB access is not needed.",
                  "mitigation": "Never log PAN, mask in logs, tokenise as early as possible, file-integrity and EDR monitoring.",
                  "modelType": "STRIDE",
